step	1	1	After reading the book
line	<col=000080>I found a <col=800000>Battered book</col> in a bookcase in <col=800000>Seers' Village</col>. It told of an old elemental workshop hidden somewhere nearby. Something might be hidden inside the book's cover. I should open the workshop beneath the anvil house, restart the water wheel and the bellows, and smelt some <col=800000>Elemental ore</col> with lava from the trough and coal. With the slashed book's instructions, the workbench should let me forge an elemental shield.</col>
done	<str>I found a Battered book in a bookcase in Seers' Village. It told of an old elemental workshop hidden somewhere nearby.</str>
done	<str>I restarted the Elemental Workshop and forged an Elemental shield from elemental metal.</str>
done	<col=ff0000>QUEST COMPLETE!</col>
